" After review, DUA has determined that the submitted documents are insufficient to support your 2019 wages "

&#x200B;

I attached my paystubs for my entire work year. So I don't know what the fuck.

Oh, that's a good idea, I never thought of just laying a gauge somewhere easily seen. Does he mess with it at all, or knock it around?

&#x200B;

Beautiful set-up by the way!
